  "scope": "Original Hy3 plan step 5 requirement and implementation; delayed asynchronous boundary",
  "step": {
    "id": 5,
    "requirement": "终局后输入不再改变状态；Restart 按钮与键盘 R 均恢复菜单状态（分数、生命、回合、序列）。",
    "implementation": "status 为 won/lost 时四区域点击不产生 signal_correct/signal_wrong，不修改 score/lives/round/progress。RESTART 控件(#restart-btn) 与 RESTART_KEY 控件(code='KeyR') 均调用 reset 逻辑：score=0、lives=3、round=1、progress=0、status='menu'、phase='menu'、event_epoch++、并从 seq=1 重新记录、emit game_reset。",
    "verification": "won 后点击黄色区域，getEvents 无新 signal_* 且 score 不变；按 KeyR 后 observe().state.status==='menu'、score=0、lives=3、round=1，且 event_epoch 较上次增大、含 game_reset(seq=1)。"
  },
